+-------------------------------------------------------
+<a name="runningTasks"></a>
+### queue.runningTasks()
+
+Returns a fresh array containing the values of tasks whose workers have started
+and have not completed. Values are returned in worker start order, including
+duplicates and `undefined`. Queued or paused tasks are not included.
